---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy policy for Small Space Style: what data this site collects, cookies, analytics and affiliate links."
>
  <section class="page">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p><em>Last updated: 19 November 2026.</em></p>
      <h2>What this site collects</h2>
      <p>
        This is a static blog. It does not run accounts, comments or a
        newsletter, and it does not ask you to create a password or submit
        personal information to read it.
      </p>
      <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
      <p>
        This site may use privacy-friendly analytics (such as Google
        Analytics) to see which guides are read and which countries readers
        come from. Analytics cookies, if used, are set by the analytics
        provider. You can block them in your browser settings.
      </p>
      <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
      <p>
        Some links on this site are affiliate links to retailers. When you
        click one and buy something, the retailer may place a cookie to
        track the referral and pay a commission. That tracking is run by
        the retailer and its affiliate network, under their own privacy
        policies — not by this site.
      </p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        If you email the address on the contact page, your email address is
        used only to reply to you. It is not sold or shared.
      </p>
      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>
        This policy may be updated as the site adds features. The date at
        the top will change when it is.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
